        the animation on several projects, including annual/sustainability
        reports, explainer videos, and social media assets. These reports have
        been officially published and are publicly accessible. Each project was
        developed in close collaboration with the team and the client to create
        a high-quality and visually compelling report. Below are links to a
        selection of projects for which I did the animation.
      </div>
      <div class='grid sm:grid-cols-2 justify-center gap-y-16 gap-x-4'>
        {
          groups.map((group) => (
            <div class='flex flex-col gap-4 sm:items-center'>
